      "version": "0.3.0",
      "date": "2026-11-25",
      "notes": "Pages load without holding the screen: the bars, menus and settings respond while a page downloads and builds. The page is painted on its own thread, and the bars and sheets are drawn on a second one. Two page buttons held together restart Primitive Launcher. Known limit: a tap on the page itself waits for a paint in progress.",
